              "type": "text",
              "text": "2018 is the centenary of the first women allowed to vote in the UK. Women working at AKU-ISMC marked this important International Women's Day by wearing a yellow rose to commemorate the achievements and struggles faced today by women everywhere.  "
            }
          ]
